#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:1 d5fd3d2ac75e46a0a7777a37593d0262
msgid "筛选栏：按标签、元素和表达式找结构"
msgstr "Filter bar: find structures by tags, elements, and expressions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:3 06349dbb12154ac686304e37818c06d7
msgid "这一页对应结构筛选栏。简单条件优先使用配置类型、化学式和元素筛选；需要组合数值条件时， 再使用 `expression`。筛选只改变匹配或选择状态，不会自动删除结构。"
msgstr ""
"This page covers the structure filter bar. Use configuration type, formula, and "
"element filters for simple conditions; use `expression` when numeric conditions must "
"be combined. Filtering changes the match or selection state only; it never deletes "
"structures automatically."

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:5 127999abb62341739da11906a1005b4b
msgid "本页目录"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11198
#: 1ecc32f00f664114a5dfa3b8ce9ef487
msgid "6. 结构筛选栏"
msgstr "6. Structure filter bar"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11200
#: 48740c407c40448ca5a55c776ef5c137
msgid "结构筛选栏可以同时使用配置类型、化学式、元素和自定义表达式。条件默认取交集；经常重复使用的组合可以保存为“常用筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"The filter bar can combine configuration type, formula, element, and custom-"
"expression filters. Conditions are intersected by default; combinations used often "
"can be saved as “saved filters”."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11202
#: 192c81314287421cadd64d11f201a045
msgid "![结构筛选栏与条件编辑器](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter.png)"
msgstr "![Structure filter bar and condition editor](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter.png)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11202
#: d700de5312574a9c959324ebc9e9d7a1
msgid "结构筛选栏与条件编辑器"
msgstr "Structure filter bar and condition editor"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11202
#: d700de5312574a9c959324ebc9e9d7a1
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter.png"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11204
#: 173f53194a35483994a63b054b5bf777
msgid "6.1 基本流程"
msgstr "6.1 Basic workflow"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11206
#: 7fbca2e2ea764e53b9f84ef93120c292
msgid "点击“筛选条件”打开编辑器。空筛选会自动出现第一行。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Filter conditions` to open the editor. An empty filter automatically starts "
"with the first row."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11207
#: 474e2465ef50412cabb1cc82df281e1d
msgid "在左下角点击“+”继续添加条件，例如“配置类型包含 `surface`”“必须包含 `Fe,O`”“不得包含 `H`”。"
msgstr ""
"Click `+` in the lower-left corner to add conditions, such as `configuration type "
"contains surface`, `must contain Fe,O`, or `must not contain H`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11208
#: 2f83dbc3c9174c34a603083826f61e25
msgid "在右上角选择“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”。"
msgstr ""
"In the upper-right corner, choose whether all conditions (AND) or any condition (OR) "
"must match."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11209
#: 504c99f87c854089a78647b39566e704
msgid "点击“完成并预览”。图中的匹配高亮只用于预览，不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Finish and preview`. Highlighted matches are for preview only and do not "
"change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11210
#: 0979608461e94d92838d3df35bc913d7
msgid "确认匹配数量后，在“应用结果”中选择“替换当前选择”“加入当前选择”或“从当前选择中移除”。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the match count, use `Apply result` to replace the current selection, "
"add to it, or remove matches from it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11212
#: dadf7cbfff184a6fbd26037e6a6083f4
msgid "修改条件后，旧匹配结果会显示为“结果已过期”。重新预览前不能继续应用旧结果。"
msgstr "After a condition changes, the previous matches are marked `Result out of date`. You cannot apply the stale result until you preview again."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11214
#: 20f34463fa5d4e8da6b267a679f8c813
msgid "编辑器右下角的垃圾篓按钮只清空筛选条件和匹配高亮，**不会清空当前选择**。清空选择位于“应用结果”菜单中。"
msgstr "The trash button in the lower-right corner clears only the filter conditions and match highlights; it **does not clear the current selection**. To clear the selection, use the `Apply result` menu."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11216
#: 85254d2cc5214b9f97b5520eb829f0b2
msgid "6.2 条件含义"
msgstr "6.2 Condition semantics"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 3b2ac090b87047dfb32b2109bc86055f
msgid "条件"
msgstr "Condition"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 556fdf38e4d8487abb048d36e13c0974
#: 751aaafaeee649bfa87a4f5739e0d717 95c04336909c4ea4885ffaa4d9ad068c
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 de68f034ddff41e0ab32cc557ad4e6e8
#: f650f37d4bc6480ca49f73265e619e2f
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 1999b7aa733c4ea2ba38dba810324acb
msgid "配置类型"
msgstr "Configuration type"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 dd8d8af420ca456abd4b536549f0e65a
msgid "包含、完全等于、开头、结尾或正则匹配"
msgstr "Contains, exactly equals, starts with, ends with, or matches a regular expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 c2086d8ebd064c638ea862ef4fdaab82
msgid "`surface`"
msgstr "`surface`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 87eedbc2ddcc459aa979a37f8516e028
msgid "化学式"
msgstr "Formula"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 1f0e52bddd354e678a07871da7006886
msgid "默认完全等于，也可选择包含或正则匹配"
msgstr "Exactly equals by default; contains and regular-expression matching are also available"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 c0f6651586864dccb39d9eb8fcd47866
msgid "`Fe2O3`"
msgstr "`Fe2O3`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 10ac2af28e2a4b1aa4f606eab5739d05
msgid "必须包含元素"
msgstr "Required elements"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 711b1187cfa44276a2b45b162b787cfa
msgid "所列元素必须全部存在，允许还有其他元素"
msgstr "Every listed element must be present; additional elements are allowed"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 27af22a791e240e0b154682f46752129
msgid "`Fe,O` 可匹配 FeO 和 FeOC"
msgstr "`Fe,O` matches both FeO and FeOC"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 fb5828ea5175412a8e558a4a5e033c7c
msgid "不得包含元素"
msgstr "Forbidden elements"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 c78474549d05494086fa8c0d35f3d66e
msgid "所列元素必须全部不存在"
msgstr "None of the listed elements may be present"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 91abdb601350416996c6a57856334ec4
msgid "`H` 排除含 H 结构"
msgstr "`H` excludes structures containing H"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 1d60778e47fc4bdb838730e07d633006
msgid "只允许这些元素"
msgstr "Allowed elements only"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 5dca49d0c8c64bc48b7d5e69c33c7ee4
msgid "结构中不能出现列表外元素"
msgstr "The structure may not contain elements outside the list"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 9396f4159e0f477e8f5d18bf5f81a0a2
msgid "`Fe,O` 可匹配 Fe、O 和 FeO"
msgstr "`Fe,O` matches Fe, O, and FeO structures"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 932c0890b5464848a1428f47e32a6130
msgid "自定义表达式"
msgstr "Custom expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 8f691be21315464c86f45637841c449f
msgid "使用现有结构表达式引擎"
msgstr "Use the existing structure-expression engine"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11289
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11422
#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11 287e27c3e7a941ed97d0b3a1e741e32c
#: 3250670299164f0bb2ad7adfd8f6fd9c 546a8705aeff4dd9ad8f599a2724da0c
msgid "`natoms > 100`"
msgstr "`natoms > 100`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11227
#: 54e675c22f444eacb055a203a933d3cf
msgid "同一条配置类型或化学式条件可以用分号输入多个值，多个值之间取“任一匹配”。元素之间使用逗号或空格分隔，例如 `Fe, O`。"
msgstr "A configuration-type or formula condition can contain multiple values separated by semicolons; any one may match. Separate elements with commas or spaces, for example `Fe, O`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11229
#: ce5b22af84204fbeb6deb956bff21532
msgid "每行左侧的开关控制该条件是否参与筛选。关闭条件不会删除输入内容。配置类型和化学式右侧的 `Aa` 控制是否区分大小写；高亮时区分，未高亮时不区分。"
msgstr "The switch on the left of each row controls whether that condition participates in filtering. Disabling a condition preserves its input. For configuration type and formula, the `Aa` button controls case sensitivity: highlighted means case-sensitive; otherwise matching ignores case."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11231
#: 76f63019c52f48d4bd82146ff5697229
msgid "非法正则、未知元素或错误表达式会直接标记对应条件，不会被当成“0 个匹配”，也不会意外匹配全部结构。"
msgstr "An invalid regular expression, unknown element, or malformed expression marks the corresponding condition as invalid. It is neither treated as zero matches nor allowed to match every structure accidentally."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11233
#: 41747ee09fcf4ae9a0dd6313f44bd84a
msgid "6.3 保存和复用常用筛选"
msgstr "6.3 Save and reuse filters"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11235
#: 1abc0d37c4e34b1394115e722172a3ce
msgid "如果经常清理同一类数据，可以保存整个条件组合。例如，一个常用组合可以是："
msgstr "If you repeatedly clean the same kind of data, save the full condition set. For example, a reusable filter might require:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11237
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11504
#: 3ad4921d1b2043d39914b16db2d17cd6 b2113469fa434f29ab9349f5498b99b6
msgid "配置类型包含 `surface`"
msgstr "Configuration type contains `surface`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11238
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11505
#: 0fca5415e89d4505bc3d00d23b2b103b c2f6a8b6644b4d359ad6f9139b0cf3dc
msgid "必须包含元素 `Fe,O`"
msgstr "Required elements: `Fe,O`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11239
#: 6531dff1a1484f54b1df1086a9b19e86
msgid "不得包含元素 `H`"
msgstr "Forbidden element: `H`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11240
#: bfd5fd8433874d499c6558b25f2b39d7
msgid "条件关系为“满足全部条件（AND）”"
msgstr "Condition relation: `Match all conditions (AND)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11242
#: 4e6d76733e924d3ebf4771bfd0a1fa5d
msgid "保存一次后，下次不需要逐行重填："
msgstr "Once saved, the filter can be reused without re-entering each row:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11244
#: 33fec4251a484f069a90b2d83f38a551
msgid "先把条件、AND/OR 关系和 `Aa` 状态设置好。"
msgstr "Set the conditions, AND/OR relation, and `Aa` state."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11245
#: d55ed604f0ff4e2c84a17dd82f8ad20f
msgid "点击“常用筛选 → 保存当前条件…”。"
msgstr "Choose `Saved filters → Save current conditions…`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11246
#: 232a6b9f451f4115b489ae3ec38549da
msgid "输入容易识别的名称，例如 `Fe-O surface`，然后点击“保存”。"
msgstr "Enter a recognizable name, such as `Fe-O surface`, then click `Save`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11247
#: cf627fe4f2474071b9b9e05fa0006a19
msgid "下次打开编辑器时，点击“常用筛选”，再直接点击该名称。"
msgstr "The next time you open the editor, choose `Saved filters` and click that name."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11249
#: 0d546cba8a0e4d09bf6e589200fe728b
msgid "![常用筛选菜单](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png)"
msgstr "![Saved filters menu](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11249
#: 4ec173961f0044078a8e116a15f56189
msgid "常用筛选菜单"
msgstr "Saved filters menu"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11249
#: 4ec173961f0044078a8e116a15f56189
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11251
#: fc0d91e6f2ac4faf8830ae0d4c2c3bd1
msgid "加载常用筛选会**替换编辑器里的当前条件**，随后更新预览；它不会自动执行“应用结果”，也不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr "Loading a saved filter **replaces the conditions currently in the editor** and then updates the preview. It does not run `Apply result` automatically or change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11253
#: b5da0d6f31fc4fcdbb6c6b798cceffc8
msgid "保存内容包括："
msgstr "A saved filter includes:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11255
#: 943fc0dfa47649e7bd67b7234bc87d42
msgid "每条条件的类型、输入值和启用状态"
msgstr "The type, input value, and enabled state of each condition"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11256
#: ade2421978e0449fb04328af8d0abc43
msgid "配置类型或化学式的匹配方式与 `Aa` 状态"
msgstr "The match mode and `Aa` state for configuration-type and formula conditions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11257
#: cec1680a46dd451da61ad3ab5c0e2cd3
msgid "“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”"
msgstr "`Match all conditions (AND)` or `Match any condition (OR)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11259
#: e4183b8ee0c14fe4b9aea72d4e66002c
msgid "常用筛选保存在本机用户配置中，关闭并重新打开软件后仍可使用。它不会保存当前匹配结果、当前选择、数据集路径或 NEP 模型；保存的是筛选条件，不是自动处理流程。"
msgstr "Saved filters are stored in the local user configuration and remain available after restarting the application. They do not store current matches, the current selection, a dataset path, or a NEP model; they store filter conditions, not an automated processing workflow."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11261
#: 67d84a7024714faba41a552583911eb3
msgid "需要维护已有条目时，进入“常用筛选 → 管理常用筛选”："
msgstr "To maintain existing entries, choose `Saved filters → Manage saved filters`:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11263
#: 64a80cdc3da54193b869314af2161baa
msgid "“重命名”只修改名称，不改变条件。"
msgstr "`Rename` changes only the name, not the conditions."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11264
#: c0d3cb6b640b428694703422c6f1cea5
msgid "“删除”只删除保存的条目，不清空编辑器中的当前条件。"
msgstr "`Delete` removes only the saved entry; it does not clear the conditions currently in the editor."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11265
#: df55e1fe04a04982816750d3e018e660
msgid "保存或重命名为已有名称时，软件会先询问是否覆盖。"
msgstr "When saving or renaming to an existing name, the application asks before overwriting it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11267
#: df224b82f83347e8a87a6f3abbcfedf3
msgid "如果条件中仍有空白行，软件不会保存。请补全该行，或用行尾的“×”先删除它。"
msgstr "A filter cannot be saved while it contains a blank row. Complete the row or remove it with the `×` at the row end."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11270
#: 1898c2c8f2424e37b11856911089dab9
msgid "6.4 `expression` 用法总览"
msgstr "6.4 `expression` overview"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11272
#: 2a74f0a7b4b145d8b0815d59612d8edc
msgid "目的：把“结构是否满足条件”写成一个布尔表达式，然后用搜索/勾选/反选按钮处理结果。"
msgstr "Purpose: express whether a structure satisfies the conditions as a Boolean expression, then process matches with the search, select, or deselect button."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11273
#: 4e7fbe8af70f4a3190bfbb80398d0c95
msgid "作用对象：仅当前 active structures；已经删除的结构不会参与表达式计算。"
msgstr "Scope: current active structures only; deleted structures are excluded from expression evaluation."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11274
#: 3666d8727a92468fac0aad1a7fa5f286
msgid "搜索按钮：高亮匹配结构。"
msgstr "Search button: highlight matching structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11275
#: dc79444fce7842fe87b3080d00672f3d
msgid "勾选按钮：把匹配结构加入当前选择集。"
msgstr "Select button: add matching structures to the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11276
#: 20571a7be7b24499992e9bc35437d099
msgid "反选按钮：把匹配结构从当前选择集中移除。"
msgstr "Deselect button: remove matching structures from the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11277
#: 7bca7cbf83f64a0a851e2ecdeef06589
msgid "删除流程不变：通常是先用 expression 勾选，再点工具栏删除按钮。"
msgstr "The deletion workflow is unchanged: normally select matches with an expression, then click the toolbar's delete button."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11279
#: 53ed9a2fa11a4f2989a2b484a1c193e9
msgid "6.4.1 支持的运算符"
msgstr "6.4.1 Supported operators"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11281
#: dead324e038f43bea8e0399a0a19a93b
msgid "逻辑运算：`&&`、`||`、`!`"
msgstr "Logical operators: `&&`, `||`, `!`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11282
#: 57a27464e48c4016a2c76eac726f7450
msgid "逻辑关键字：`and`、`or`、`not`"
msgstr "Logical keywords: `and`, `or`, `not`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11283
#: 48c52287bbbb4069801d7ab127986563
msgid "比较运算：`>`、`>=`、`<`、`<=`、`==`、`!=`"
msgstr "Comparison operators: `>`, `>=`, `<`, `<=`, `==`, `!=`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11284
#: ced74ae03ab947c0963e1c02c06b1484
msgid "算术运算：`+`、`-`、`*`、`/`"
msgstr "Arithmetic operators: `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11285
#: 81117afcad8d4afab8cec71267060558
msgid "括号：`(`、`)`"
msgstr "Parentheses: `(`, `)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11287
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11321
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11369
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11388
#: 378650960c934e6e8bdaf17b0f3c8632 550c86fb627c4c829849cda9ccaae7a9
#: bcd5dba4a73947f9921e8d9ad6d96df4 ccb489f9d78f4996a9726325ee0dece3
msgid "示例："
msgstr "Examples:"

